  <!-- EN: cleansing boltgun -->
  <Gun_CleansingBolter.label>净世爆弹枪</Gun_CleansingBolter.label>
  <!-- EN: One of the most effective anti-neconoid firearm developed by the brilliant minds of the glitterworld mechanists. This bolter fires bolter rounds which is filled with ANB "Anti Necronoid Biomass" nanites, where once inside a necronoid, it'll run rampant and destroy necronoid cells, dealing heavy amounts of damage to a necronoid entity while deals normal damage to normal living beings.\n\nSuch a weapon was developed after experiencing countless deaths and losses, where humanity finally reached a breakthrough in pushing back the necronoid army. -->
  <Gun_CleansingBolter.description>由闪耀世界最顶尖的技师研制的先进武器，也是最适合反制殁疫感染体的武器。净世爆弹枪所使用的弹药内装有反殁疫病毒（简称“ANB”）纳米机械，击中殁疫感染体后会迅速破坏它们的细胞组织，以此造成极高的额外伤害。\n\n虽然这种武器的研制伴随着无数的流血与牺牲，但也帮助人类在击退殁疫尸军方面取得了重大进展。</Gun_CleansingBolter.description>
  <!-- EN: grip -->
  <Gun_CleansingBolter.tools.grip.label>握把</Gun_CleansingBolter.tools.grip.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <Gun_CleansingBolter.tools.barrel.label>枪管</Gun_CleansingBolter.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: cleansing boltgun -->
  <Gun_CleansingBolter.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>净世爆弹枪</Gun_CleansingBolter.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: cleansing rocket launcher -->
  <Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.label>净世火箭发射器</Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.label>
  <!-- EN: A single use rocket launcher used to destroy fortified necronoid structures and boss-like necronoid entities. The rocket launcher fires a concentrated ANB nanite rockets in a single exchange, and can decimate anything under a 2.9 blast radius. The rocket launcher has a maximum number of 100 shots before it becomes un-usable. -->
  <Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.description>用于高效摧毁殁疫建筑和对抗高阶殁疫感染体的武器。净世火箭发射器所使用的火箭弹内装有反殁疫病毒（简称“ANB”）纳米机械，击中殁疫感染体后会迅速破坏它们的细胞组织，以此造成极高的额外伤害。\n\n\n\n这种武器仅装有100枚火箭弹，消耗完毕后将无法使用。</Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.description>
  <!-- EN: charge -->
  <Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.comps.CompReloadable_Weapon.chargeNoun>火箭弹</Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.comps.CompReloadable_Weapon.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.comps.CompReloadable_Weapon.cooldownGerund>冷却中</Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.comps.CompReloadable_Weapon.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.tools.barrel.label>枪管</Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: cleansing rocket launcher -->
  <Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.verbs.VerbShootReloadable.label>净世火箭发射器</Gun_CleansingRocketLauncher.verbs.VerbShootReloadable.label>
  
  <!-- EN: cleansing shotgun -->
  <Gun_CleansingShotgun.label>净世霰弹枪</Gun_CleansingShotgun.label>
  <!-- EN: A KS 23 shotgun carbine that fires cleansing shotgun shells. Due to its rifled barrel, the cleansing shotgun can fire cleansing pellets at an incredible range, which is a stark contrast towards other shotguns out there. Though it possess a slow fire rate, each shot packs a lot of fire power coupled with a strong stopping power which is capable of nailing down fast moving opponents in its place. This shotgun also deals a monstrous damage againsts any necronoid entity, giving it a fitting title as "The Doom Giver". -->
  <Gun_CleansingShotgun.description>以KS-23泵动霰弹枪为蓝本研制而成的武器，其使用的弹药内装有反殁疫病毒（简称“ANB”）纳米机械，击中殁疫感染体后会迅速破坏它们的细胞组织，以此造成极高的额外伤害。净世霰弹枪配备有特殊改装过的枪管，射程要比寻常的霰弹枪远得多。虽然射速不快，但在它强劲的伤害与抑制能力面前，任何殁疫感染体都无法前进半步，有些人便据此将其称作“毁灭使者”。</Gun_CleansingShotgun.description>
  <!-- EN: grip -->
  <Gun_CleansingShotgun.tools.grip.label>握把</Gun_CleansingShotgun.tools.grip.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <Gun_CleansingShotgun.tools.barrel.label>枪管</Gun_CleansingShotgun.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: cleansing shotgun -->
  <Gun_CleansingShotgun.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>净世霰弹枪</Gun_CleansingShotgun.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
