  <!-- EN: heavy flamer -->
  <Gun_HeavyFlamer.label>重型怒焰喷射器</Gun_HeavyFlamer.label>
  <!-- EN: A long-ranged heavy flamer. This weapon is capable of spreading fire in a very wide area, plunging an entire area in a sea of inferno. Very effective in taking down necronoid structures in a safe distance.\n\nThis weapon only has a limited number of 500 shots before the weapon becomes un-usable. -->
  <Gun_HeavyFlamer.description>能快速令大片区域化作火海的重型怒焰喷射器。射程极远，适合用来高效摧毁各种殁疫感染体建筑。\n\n这种武器仅装有500单位的燃料，消耗完毕后将无法使用。</Gun_HeavyFlamer.description>
  <!-- EN: charge -->
  <Gun_HeavyFlamer.comps.CompReloadable_Weapon.chargeNoun>燃料</Gun_HeavyFlamer.comps.CompReloadable_Weapon.chargeNoun>
