  <!-- EN: imperial cleansing autocannon -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingAutocannon.label>帝国净世重炮</Gun_ImperialCleansingAutocannon.label>
  <!-- EN: One of the most effective heavy weapon againsts any necronoid entity. The autocannon uses a special 20mm AP cleansing bullet, capable of breaching even the hardest of necronoid flesh and deals massive amounts of damage upon impact. This weapon is seen being used by the imperial necro hunters. -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingAutocannon.description>通常由破碎帝国的殁疫猎人们使用的重型武器，其使用的20mm穿甲弹药内装有反殁疫病毒（简称“ANB”）纳米机械，击中殁疫感染体后会迅速破坏它们的细胞组织，以此造成极高的额外伤害。即使抛开这些不谈，帝国净世重炮本身的伤害与穿甲能力也足够出色，任何殁疫感染体都无法挡下它的一击。</Gun_ImperialCleansingAutocannon.description>
  <!-- EN: grip -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingAutocannon.tools.grip.label>握把</Gun_ImperialCleansingAutocannon.tools.grip.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingAutocannon.tools.barrel.label>枪管</Gun_ImperialCleansingAutocannon.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: imperial cleansing autocannon -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingAutocannon.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>帝国净世重炮</Gun_ImperialCleansingAutocannon.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: imperial cleansing boltgun -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingBolter.label>帝国净世爆弹枪</Gun_ImperialCleansingBolter.label>
  <!-- EN: A special cleansing bolter designed for imperial use. Unlike the original, this weapon receives better modifications, giving it extented bolter magazine and reinforced gun barrel. -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingBolter.description>专为破碎帝国的士兵们设计的先进武器，其使用的弹药内装有反殁疫病毒（简称“ANB”）纳米机械，击中殁疫感染体后会迅速破坏它们的细胞组织，以此造成极高的额外伤害。与普通的净世爆弹枪有所不同，帝国净世爆弹枪经过了诸多改装，配备有更出色的加长弹匣和加固枪管。</Gun_ImperialCleansingBolter.description>
  <!-- EN: grip -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingBolter.tools.grip.label>握把</Gun_ImperialCleansingBolter.tools.grip.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingBolter.tools.barrel.label>枪管</Gun_ImperialCleansingBolter.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: imperial cleansing boltgun -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingBolter.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>帝国净世爆弹枪</Gun_ImperialCleansingBolter.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: imperial cleansing bolter machinegun -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingBolterMG.label>帝国净世爆弹机枪</Gun_ImperialCleansingBolterMG.label>
  <!-- EN: A special cleansing bolter machinegun designed for imperial use. Although slightly in-accurate, it can fire a barrage of cleansing bullets at long distances, perfect for providing suppressive fire. -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingBolterMG.description>专为破碎帝国的士兵们设计的先进武器，其使用的弹药内装有反殁疫病毒（简称“ANB”）纳米机械，击中殁疫感染体后会迅速破坏它们的细胞组织，以此造成极高的额外伤害。虽然精度不高，但帝国净世爆弹机枪能远距离提供极强的压制火力。</Gun_ImperialCleansingBolterMG.description>
  <!-- EN: grip -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingBolterMG.tools.grip.label>握把</Gun_ImperialCleansingBolterMG.tools.grip.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingBolterMG.tools.barrel.label>枪管</Gun_ImperialCleansingBolterMG.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: imperial cleansing bolter machinegun -->
  <Gun_ImperialCleansingBolterMG.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>帝国净世爆弹机枪</Gun_ImperialCleansingBolterMG.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Lahti L-39 "incendiary" -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryAntiMaterial.label>L-39反坦克步枪（怒焰）</Gun_IncendiaryAntiMaterial.label>
  <!-- EN: An incendiary version of the Lahti L-39 anti- material, which uses AP incendiary rounds. This gun hits the hardest among the other incendiary weapons, thanks to its frame made of plasteel, the gun wont be destroyed due to the immense recoil. -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryAntiMaterial.description>于古地球第二次世界大战期间研制并生产的反坦克步枪。这种武器因具有出色的精度、射程和穿甲能力而荣获“猎象枪”的绰号，但亦有不便携带、后坐力过大等缺点。\n\n这种武器发射特制的穿甲燃烧弹，经过玻璃钢加固的枪身显著降低了它开火时产生的后坐力。</Gun_IncendiaryAntiMaterial.description>
  <!-- EN: stock -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryAntiMaterial.tools.stock.label>枪托</Gun_IncendiaryAntiMaterial.tools.stock.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryAntiMaterial.tools.barrel.label>枪管</Gun_IncendiaryAntiMaterial.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: Lahti L-39 "incendiary" -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryAntiMaterial.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>L-39反坦克步枪（怒焰）</Gun_IncendiaryAntiMaterial.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Sturmgewehr 44 "incendiary" -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryAssaultRifle.label>StG44突击步枪（怒焰）</Gun_IncendiaryAssaultRifle.label>
  <!-- EN: An incendiary version of the standard sturmgewehr 44, which uses AP incendiary rounds. This gun is somewhat light-weight and very compact which offers ease of use during deployment, and just like the MG-42, its barrel is reinforced in plasteel for continous automatic fire in medium range. -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryAssaultRifle.description>于古地球第二次世界大战末期研制并生产的突击步枪，也是人类史上首种大规模装备的、真正意义上的突击步枪。\n\n这种武器发射特制的穿甲燃烧弹，经过玻璃钢加固的枪管使它可以更频繁地连续开火。</Gun_IncendiaryAssaultRifle.description>
  <!-- EN: stock -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryAssaultRifle.tools.stock.label>枪托</Gun_IncendiaryAssaultRifle.tools.stock.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryAssaultRifle.tools.barrel.label>枪管</Gun_IncendiaryAssaultRifle.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: Sturmgewehr 44 "incendiary" -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryAssaultRifle.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>StG44突击步枪（怒焰）</Gun_IncendiaryAssaultRifle.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: MG-42 "incendiary" -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryMachineGun.label>MG42通用机枪（怒焰）</Gun_IncendiaryMachineGun.label>
  <!-- EN: An incendiary version of the standard mg-42, which uses AP incendiary rounds. Using plasteel as a material for the gun barrel, the gun is immune to over-heating which allows for continuous firing, although it requires an amount of finesse to accurately use this gun. -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryMachineGun.description>于古地球第二次世界大战末期被德军广泛使用的气冷式通用机枪。这种射速极高的武器开火时有着“滋滋滋滋”的独特枪声，因此荣获“希特勒的电锯”、“撕布机”等绰号。\n\n这种武器发射特制的穿甲燃烧弹，经过玻璃钢加固的枪管使它可以更频繁地连续开火。</Gun_IncendiaryMachineGun.description>
  <!-- EN: stock -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryMachineGun.tools.stock.label>枪托</Gun_IncendiaryMachineGun.tools.stock.label>
  <!-- EN: barrel -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryMachineGun.tools.barrel.label>枪管</Gun_IncendiaryMachineGun.tools.barrel.label>
  <!-- EN: MG-42 "incendiary" -->
  <Gun_IncendiaryMachineGun.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>MG42通用机枪（怒焰）</Gun_IncendiaryMachineGun.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: custom remington 870 -->
